@startuml
title Job Vacancy lifecycle (HubSpot job vacancy object)

[*] --> Content_Available

Content_Available --> Requirements_Available

Requirements_Available --> Deal_Won

Deal_Won --> Campaign_Live

Campaign_Live --> Campaign_Closed

note right of Campaign_Live
The vacancy is published and the
integration with Meta is active.
end note

Campaign_Closed --> [*]

note right of Campaign_Closed
All candidates associated with this
vacancy are set to Rejected.
end note

@enduml
